    Client -- Port 80 (HTTP) & 443 (HTTPS) --> Nginx
    Nginx -- / (HTTP Traffic) --> Gunicorn
    Nginx -- /ws/ (WebSocket Traffic) --> Daphne
    Gunicorn --> Instance1 & Instance2 & Instance3
    Daphne --> Instance1 & Instance2 & Instance3
    Instance1 --> Postgres & Redis
    Instance2 --> Postgres & Redis
    Instance3 --> Postgres & Redis

